   // Forward raw touch-surface position to the gamepadtouchevent channel so
-  // app-side swipe detection (e.g. Plezy's AppleTvRemoteTouchService) can
-  // resolve a swipe gesture in Dart. We deliberately do NOT synthesize arrow
-  // keys from analog dpad values here — those would fire spurious "opposite
-  // direction" events as the finger naturally pivots through the touch
-  // surface during a lift. Directional clicks come from the UIKit press path
-  // (pressesBegan → maybeSynthesizeForPress) with a GameController cardinal
-  // dpad fallback for the 2021 Siri Remote's physical outer ring.
+  // app-side swipe detection can resolve a swipe gesture in Dart. Directional
+  // click buttons are handled only by the UIKit press UIEvent path below.
